        "978-0261103344 | The Hobbit | J.R.R. Tolkien | 1937 | 3/3 in",
        "978-0441172719 | Dune | Frank Herbert | 1965 | 1/1 in",
        "978-0618640157 | The Lord of the Rings | J.R.R. Tolkien | 1954 | 2/2 in",
        "978-0261103344 | The Hobbit | J.R.R. Tolkien | 1937 | 3/3 in",
        "978-0618640157 | The Lord of the Rings | J.R.R. Tolkien | 1954 | 2/2 in",
