    {
      "type": "code",
      "carry": true,
      "title": "Lend and return copies",
      "prompt": [
        "Give `Book` two methods and wire them to new commands.",
        "",
        "- `bool TryLend()`: `false` when no copy is in, otherwise one fewer copy is in.",
        "- `bool TryReturn()`: `false` when every copy is already in, otherwise one more is in.",
        "",
        "Commands:",
        "",
        "| Input | Output |",
        "|---|---|",
        "| `lend <isbn>` | `Lent: The Hobbit (2/3 in)` |",
        "| `lend` with no copy in | `Error: no copies of The Hobbit are in` |",
        "| `return <isbn>` | `Returned: The Hobbit (3/3 in)` |",
        "| `return` when all are in | `Error: every copy of The Hobbit is already in` |",
        "| either with an unknown ISBN | `Error: no book with ISBN 123` |",
        "",
        "`stats` gains the copies on loan: `Books: 3 | Copies: 6 | On loan: 1 | Oldest: 1937` (the empty case stays `Books: 0 | Copies: 0`). `help` becomes `Commands: add, list, find, authors, lend, return, stats, fine, help, quit`.",
        "",
        "Input:",
        "",
